          ],
          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 3,
          "question": {
            "text": "Sodium nitroprusside, when added to an alkaline solution of sulphide ions, produce a",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "MKbVe",
              "text": "red colouration",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "YlIcE",
              "text": "blue colouration",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "zwgo8",
              "text": "purple colouration",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "RwOBU",
              "text": "brown colouration",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "<p>This test is used for the presence of sulphur in any compound. When sodium nitroprusside, react with sulphide ion, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> the following reaction takes place</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>NO</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>&#10230;</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced><mrow><mi>Sod</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nitroprusside</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>purple</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>coloration</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sod</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>thionitroprusside</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
            "image": null
          },
          "videoSolution": null,
          "questionLabels": [],
          "syllabusCategory": "noChange",
          "questionStructure": [
            "default"
          ],
          "previousYear": {
